OL,3,GNEWSAFormer factory could make way for
OL,4,Asupermarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer factory buildings could be
OL,7,Fdemolished to make way for a
OL,8,Fsupermarket.
OL,10,FLidl is proposing to open a store with
OL,11,Fassociated parking on Katmex's site on
OL,12,FGeorge Street in Seaham.
OL,14,FIt has been empty since the steel parts
OL,15,Fmanufacturer moved out earlier this
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FThe development, on the edge of the
OL,19,Ftown centre, would create 40 jobs, the
OL,20,Fapplicants said. Durham County Council
OL,21,Fis expected to make a decision on the
OL,22,Fplans by 22 December.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
